# Mission

Strengthen **machine understanding** of ORA · Solana West · New Zayed with **valid**, **non-duplicative** JSON-LD that **matches** visible copy and **01**.

# Stack principles

- **JSON-LD** preferred; **server-render** when possible.
- **No hidden** FAQ / Review / Offer schema — must mirror on-page truth (**07**).
- **One** coherent graph per page where practical; avoid conflicting `WebPage`/`Organization` descriptions across templates.
- Keep payloads **lean**; lazy-load only if framework requires — performance in **13**.

# Types (use when applicable)

| Type | Typical use |
|------|-------------|
| `Organization` | ORA / site publisher; sitewide |
| `WebSite` | Site + SearchAction if real site search exists |
| `WebPage` | Page topic; link `@id` breadcrumbs |
| `BreadcrumbList` | All indexable funnels |
| `FAQPage` | FAQ modules with real Q&A only |
| `RealEstateListing` / `Offer` | Inventory or project sales detail when data is accurate |
| `Article` | Blog / guides |
| `LocalBusiness` | If NAP and service area are consistent with **11** |
| `ContactPage` | Dedicated contact |
| `ImageObject` | Hero / OG-critical images when worth annotating |

# Field discipline

- **Product facts** (price bands, delivery, plan) must follow **01** and page body.
- **FAQ** answers: same text as UI; include numbers when the question expects them.

# Entity linking

Reuse stable `@id` URLs for **Organization**, **WebSite**, and key **WebPage** nodes across routes so **AI** and crawlers connect entities.

# Local / geo

Reference New Zayed · West Cairo · Mehwar El Dabaa where **LocalBusiness** or `areaServed` makes sense — stay consistent with **01** / location copy.

# Coordination

- **Snippets & extractable answers:** **03**
- **Meta / URL clarity:** **15**
- **Broker SEO taxonomy:** **02**

# Quality bar

Valid schema, **no** fake ratings, **no** keyword stuffing in `description` fields; if unsure, **omit** optional fields.
